LAME 3.100 exports lame_init_old in include/libmp3lame.sym, but the function was removed
from the sources, so modern Apple linkers refuse the symbol list. Drop that one line.
Applied by scripts/build-indexdown.sh with: patch -p1 (from the lame-3.100 directory).

--- a/include/libmp3lame.sym
+++ b/include/libmp3lame.sym
@@ -1,5 +1,4 @@
 lame_init
-lame_init_old
 lame_set_num_samples
 lame_get_num_samples
 lame_set_in_samplerate
